Yep, give me that old PYEC and a wand of death, and we'll see just
how tough the Wizard is. Killed him 10 times without him ever doing
_anything_ to me.

Final stats were something like: level 30, straight 18's for all ability
scores (that's without gauntlets & helm of course), ~280 hit points,
AC -37, +5 mjollnir & +5 vorpie. Final score: ~4.2 million.

Now that I've done it the _easy_ way, I'll try ascending a difficult
