I'm very proud of this. Did anyone else make their first ascension
with a Tourist, or know of anyone who did? This has to be a fairly
rare feat, surely? :-) But I gotta say it, _anyone_ who has 2 wands
of wishing and the collected wisdom of rec.games.hack simply CANNOT
